#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0233 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "Mirror-asymmetry pin against PMDA-AD0232-valid_no_tr01pg1n_column-ADSL.cdt: the same absent column, the opposite verdict. TRxxPGy matches TR01PG1 so the template expands (xx=01, y=1) and Requirements.Variables.All rewrites to ['TR01PG1N'], which is absent -> reported not executed with the Requirements.Variables reason. Here TR01PG1N is the rule's TARGET, whereas for AD0232 it is the KEY."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TR01PG1 type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | POOLA
S1 | 002 | POOLA
S1 | 003 | POOLAA
